// Write the image to the dataset
GDALRasterBand* pRasterBand = pDataset->GetRasterBand(1);
pRasterBand->WriteRaster(0, 0, 256, 256, &image[0][0], GDT_8UInt);
```

#### 5. **Close the Dataset**
```cpp
GDALClose(pDataset);
```

